      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-01-08T14:12:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e How many more contributions we have thanks to this relaxation of the rule\n\nSurely someone doesn\u0027t not contribute to Gerrit because of this release footer, this should not be a measure of success of removing the footer I don\u0027t think...\n\nThe main aspect I\u0027m worried about is the quality of the release notes, but from my first test, doesn\u0027t look too bad.",
      "parentUuid": "dcb9db6b_9b85988c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 11,
        "startChar": 43,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 25
      },
      "revId": "2c8c67a9828ae39e174dbc99e20aa7dabc306bb5",
