      "writtenOn": "2025-12-17T13:27:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After seeing https://youtu.be/Bdi_pYSCJLc?si\u003dI0GcMh2vnDRM10Vd\u0026t\u003d1045\nI got idea to use AI for release notes.",
      "revId": "2c8c67a9828ae39e174dbc99e20aa7dabc306bb5",
